mal existe. Mas o seu efeito no teu foco \xe9 real."',icon:'ghost',color:'#f59e0b',unlockMethod:{type:'boss_drop',bossId:'break_boss_void_wraith_silent',category:'dungeon_break'}},{id:'shadow_corrupted_monk',name:'Monge das Sombras Corrompido',rank:'Commander',type:'Support',dropRate:0,dropChance:.18,passiveEffect:{type:'xp_boost',value:.15,description:'+15% XP em todas as miss\xf5es'},lore:'"Recita mantras de poder que ressoam atrav\xe9s do Sistema."',icon:'hands-pray',color:'#f59e0b',unlockMethod:{type:'boss_drop',bossId:'break_boss_corrupted_monk_temple',category:'dungeon_break'}},{id:'shadow_abyssal_beast',name:'Besta da Quimera Sombria',rank:'Commander',type:'Beast',dropRate:0,dropChance:.18,passiveEffect:{type:'penalty_reduce',value:.15,description:'-15% na perda de XP por penalidade'},lore:'"Um am\xe1lgama de pesadelos. Nada no mundo real a pode ferir."',icon:'dog-side',color:'#f59e0b',unlockMethod:{type:'boss_drop',bossId:'break_boss_abyssal_beast_chimera',category:'dungeon_break'}},{id:'shadow_chaos_reaper',name:'Reaper do Caos Sombrio',rank:'Commander',type:'Assassin',dropRate:0,dropChance:.18,passiveEffect:{type:'xp_boost',value:.18,description:'+18% XP em todas as miss\xf5es'},lore:'"Colhe a incerteza com a sua foice. O teu caminho fica limpo."',icon:'skull',color:'#f59e0b',unlockMethod:{type:'boss_drop',bossId:'break_boss_chaos_reaper_final',category:'dungeon_break'}},{id:'shadow_ancient_machine_core',name:'N\xfacleo Mec\xe2nico Sombrio',rank:'Commander',type:'Artisan',dropRate:0,dropChance:.18,passiveEffect:{type:'gold_boost',value:.16,description:'+16% Gold em todas as miss\xf5es'},lore:'"Processa a fortuna com uma efici\xeancia inumana."',icon:'engine',color:'#f59e0b',unlockMethod:{type:'boss_drop',bossId:'break_boss_ancient_machine_core',category:'dungeon_break'}},{id:'shadow_star_spawn_void',name:'Prole do Vazio Sombria',rank:'Marshal',type:'Ancient',dropRate:0,dropChance:.12,passiveEffect:{type:'xp_boost',value:.3,description:'+30% XP em todas as 